       specificity, same as .is-cover-receded overriding cover's own
       opacity. 1320ms = the original 320ms +1000ms: a slower, more
       elegant fade-out for MemoryScene's own text/panel on its way out,
       without touching when the video itself starts (runDestinationVideoAndReveal
       kicks off playback immediately, independent of this CSS duration --
       see that function's own comment), so the handoff still reads as
       continuous. */
    .experience.is-memory-receded .experience__scene--memory {
