    Very faint global ivory veil over the video -- same rgba(255,254,248,…)
    ink as the local halos behind the text, just spread thin across the
    whole frame instead of pooled locally. Meant to lift the footage only
    a touch, never to whiten or read as a visible overlay: no filter/
    brightness anywhere (see the explicit guarantee on
    .experience__journey-video above), just a plain, low-opacity flat
    layer, sitting behind the text/CTA (DOM order: video, then this veil,
