    /* Journey recedes while .is-journey-receded is present -- defined
       after the existing ".is-revealing-journey .experience__scene--journey
       {opacity:1}" rule above so it wins on the (otherwise equal)
       specificity, same trick as .is-destination-receded overriding
       destination's own opacity. Plain baseline duration (matches
       destination's own back/forward panel fade) -- no bespoke extended
       timing invented here, per "mantén el patrón existente". */
    .experience.is-journey-receded .experience__scene--journey {
      transition: opacity 360ms ease;
      opacity: 0;
